/* The Watching strip (WatchRelations.tsx `SessionWatchStrip`) is drawn in the Background processes
   tray's own shell (.bg-tray) with Tasks created here's rows and links (.ct-*); these are only what a
   wait adds to them. Folded, what the wait needs (a threshold, a count) sits where a lone target's name
   would, and truncates before the sentence beside it does. Opened, each watch lists its targets in the
   list's grey; the line under it is the one said only while nobody is checking the watch. */
.watch-strip-target {
